📊 Financial KPI Dashboard (Streamlit)

A lightweight, user-friendly data application built with Streamlit to automate financial KPI analysis and reporting. This tool enables users to upload datasets, explore key metrics, and generate insights without needing technical expertise.

🚀 Overview

This application is designed to simplify financial analysis workflows by:

Automating KPI calculations

Providing interactive data exploration

Enabling quick visualisation of trends and performance

Supporting self-service analytics for business users

It demonstrates how data engineering + lightweight web apps can improve decision-making and operational efficiency.

✨ Features

📂 Upload CSV datasets

👀 Preview and explore raw data

🎯 Dynamic KPI selection (e.g., revenue, cost)

📊 KPI summary (Total, Average, Count)

📈 Time-series trend visualisation

🔍 Category-based filtering

📋 Aggregated breakdown by category

⬇️ Download filtered data
